tively in English about the communicative  topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic   vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible   pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative  topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic   vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible   pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Small Talk at Work"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you meet new people, you exchange small talk.  Small talk can be about the weather, the city you are in, or  general details about you.</br></br>It is not polite to ask people about religion, politics, marital  status, if they have or want children, how much money they  make or how much they paid for an item.</br></br>North Americans may be surprised in a bad way if you ask these things or say these things when you do not know them well."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Yourself at Work"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about yourself at work, you may use the Simple Present Tense or the Present Continuous tense."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Simple Present  tense</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Present  Continuous tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm tired.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm learning a lot.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have a lot to do!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm finding it a bit  difficult.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd like to meet everyone.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm starting to find  my way around.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "half an hour"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "30 minutes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The meeting starts in half an hour."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you chat with colleagues."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "get together"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a gathering of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are having an office get together in 30 minutes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "informal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "relaxed; casual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The dinner is informal. You can wear jeans."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "system"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way of doing things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have to learn our system of giving out work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "information"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "news; facts; knowledge"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a lot of information to read at a new job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to finish up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to complete what you are doing now"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Finish up your work, then meet us in the cafe."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le06ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Think of things to say to a North American worker."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Write 3 questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 statements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say your questions and statements to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about what to say to a North American worker."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I am culturally appropriate when dealing with another worker."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk with my partner about small talk."}]}]}